# Where the dashboard fetches the vps-cron status server.
#
# Empty means this site's own origin, which is the deployed shape: the
# dashboard is served from the root of cron.tomplanche.com, where the status
# server already answers /health, /jobs and /runs. `vite dev` and
# `vite preview` proxy those three paths, so dev matches.
#
# An origin (`cron.tomplanche.com`, or `https://cron.tomplanche.com`) is used
# as-is instead, in dev and in the build alike. It needs the API to answer with
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin for this site; see the README.
VITE_API_BASE=""
